WEBVTT

1
00:00:20.745 --> 00:00:22.406
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It’s a beautiful evening.

2
00:00:23.312 --> 00:00:27.646
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yes, it is. I love it here.

3
00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:32.283
I came here a lot with my dad when I was a child.

4
00:00:33.253 --> 00:00:35.215
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Did you live near here?

5
00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:39.485
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Not far. We lived in Camden Town.

6
00:00:39.744 --> 00:00:41.599
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Oh, nice.

7
00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:49.060
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> So…do you really want to see my photos now?

8
00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:50.936
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes, I do.

9
00:00:52.316 --> 00:00:56.974
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Here. Go ahead. This is my portfolio.

10
00:01:00.037 --> 00:01:04.889
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Wow, these are…really professional.

11
00:01:06.247 --> 00:01:08.167
Amazing, Izzy!

12
00:01:08.706 --> 00:01:21.753
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Thanks…You know, there’s this job I really want…well, I think I want it…

13
00:01:22.054 --> 00:01:23.391
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> What job?

14
00:01:24.254 --> 00:01:26.066
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I want to be a photo editor.

15
00:01:27.101 --> 00:01:34.239
I…sent in an application and I got an interview.

16
00:01:35.101 --> 00:01:37.732
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Wow, that’s great!

17
00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:41.290
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> But…I don’t know.

18
00:01:43.274 --> 00:01:45.237
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> You don’t know, what?

19
00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:49.744
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Well…I’ve never worked in a job like that before.

20
00:01:50.412 --> 00:01:52.914
I’m not sure I’m ready for it.

21
00:01:54.725 --> 00:01:59.513
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Izzy. Your photos are awesome!

22
00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:04.149
I think the magazine would be lucky to have you.

23
00:02:05.271 --> 00:02:06.457
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Do you think so?

24
00:02:07.535 --> 00:02:09.583
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah! Of course!

25
00:02:13.336 --> 00:02:14.630
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I think so, too.

26
00:02:31.299 --> 00:02:33.542
You can say more nice things about my photos now.

27
00:02:33.542 --> 00:02:40.270
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Ah, yes, ma’am. Ah, wow, look at this one.

28
00:02:41.068 --> 00:02:48.098
Now that is amazing! And that one? Incredible!

29
00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:53.533
That, now that is just wonderful.

30
00:02:55.064 --> 00:02:57.522
Perfection, perfection.

31
00:02:59.743 --> 00:03:01.361
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Thank you, Ben.